# Source-grounded exercise recipe: Wave I, Exploration, Sleep. The transcript
# asks the listener to lie down, checks right-ear orientation, then names the
# preparatory order explicitly: Energy Conversion Box, Resonant Tuning,
# Resonant Energy Balloon, Affirmation and Focus 10.
#
# This is a sleep tape, not a visit followed by a return. The exercise itself
# counts from eleven to twenty and the manual says the signals fade while the
# listener remains in natural sleep. No waking count, return-method briefing,
# Clear Skies or invented exploration hold belongs after it.

@title    Exploration, Sleep
@level    F10
@ending   stay
@pan      right
@seed     10105
@verbosity 3

surf 0.55
use orientation

surf 0.30
use conversion-box

surf 0.18
use resonant-tuning
use balloon
use affirmation

surf 0.0
use relax-10
use exploration-sleep
